Defects found:

- `scripts/rederive_manuscript_count_2026_08_19.py:93` — DIFFERENT COPY.  
  Exact input: `verify_delivered_bytes.PAGES={"t":"declared.html"}`; audit row `{"topic":"t","page":"audited.html","paper_chars":0}`; `ssot/x/t.json={"title":"T"}`; `hit.html` contains `id="pn-search"`, `T`, and a >=1500-char `pn-paper`; `declared.html` exists with a <1500-char `pn-paper` and no title hit.  
  Consequence: the script reports the title-matched page as delivered even though the repository declaration points to a different artifact.

- `scripts/rederive_manuscript_count_2026_08_19.py:56` — SELECTOR/MARKER PAIRING ERROR.  
  Exact input to `paper_chars`: `<!--end-paper--><section id="pn-paper">` + 1600 text chars + `</section><!--end-paper-->`.  
  Consequence: it returns `None` because it finds the first end marker in the file, not the first end marker after `pn-paper`.

- `scripts/rederive_manuscript_count_2026_08_19.py:77` — SELECTOR KEYED TO ONE HTML FORM.  
  Exact input: `p.html` contains `<div id='pn-search'>T</div><section id="pn-paper">` + 1600 chars + `<!--end-paper-->`; matching `ssot/x/t.json={"title":"T"}`.  
  Consequence: the delivered page is excluded from `tabbed` solely because the valid HTML uses single quotes.

- `scripts/rederive_manuscript_count_2026_08_19.py:85` / `:88` — SELECTOR KEYED TO ONE ESCAPE FORM.  
  Exact input: title `King's Trial`; HTML contains `id="pn-search"` and `King&#39;s Trial`, not raw apostrophe or `&#x27;`.  
  Consequence: the page is missed although it contains the same title.

- `scripts/rederive_manuscript_count_2026_08_19.py:132` — CHECK CANNOT FAIL on non-assessable derivation.  
  Exact input: `verify_delivered_bytes.PAGES={}`; audit row `{"topic":"t","page":"missing.html","paper_chars":0}`; no matching title/page files.  
  Consequence: it prints `NOT_ASSESSABLE: 1` and still exits `0`.

